    "body": "I'm not sure we want to overcomplicate this with a Wattsi change. Instead, we should just be able to do something like `<span data-x=\"concept-microsyntax-parse-error\" id=\"parse-error-srcset\">`. The tricky part is indeed coming up with all the different ID suffixes, but it sounds like there's at least some things to draw inspiration from.\n\nMy impression was that the ask was for `id=\"\"` attributes in the source, not textual insertions like \"(PE-5)\".\n",
