    "body": "@haroldfredshort As a first pass, using the applicable one from the file I linked to above would probably be a good move—though they could do with being more consistent and a few of them are a bit meaningless (mostly Adoption Agency Algorithm, AAA, ones where whomever originally wrote that didn't know quite what case caused that parse error to be thrown). Really you don't need to look at that file all the time, but you probably want to take the general sort of standard structure of them.\n",
